    scope: "For internal DHS and DSD staff at any level who get handed a problem that will not resolve: policy and program staff, operations, quality and performance, data and research, communications and learning design, fiscal, contracts, grants and procurement staff, community engagement, administrative and support staff, supervisors and managers. Four short lessons you can take in any order and return to. Voluntary and self-directed: no score, no ranking, no completion requirement, and nothing you write in a reflection is collected. This module never asks you to disclose your own identity, health, history or beliefs. Completion here does not count toward DHS-required training credits unless management, a director, or DHS leadership expressly approves an exception.",
