            "An issue rarely arrives as a question. It arrives as a solution (“we need a new form”), as blame (“that region is not following the policy”), as a compliance check (“are we out of step with the rule?”) or as a single story (“I heard about a family up north”). Each of those closes the question before anyone asks it.",
